{"id":"2aa449de50b1c012","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-isomorphism.md","title":"Structure Isomorphisms and Induced Substructures","display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms and Induced Substructures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-isomorphism","aliases":["67-df-isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms and Induced Substructures","depends_on":["[[67-df-satisfaction]]","[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphisms and Induced Substructures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,K\">\\(L,K\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a> 的签名；结构及其解释族取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a>。每个下列构造仅在其列明的输入类型上定义。</li>\n<li>同构与子结构谓词使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:|M|\\to|N|\">\\(b:|M|\\to|N|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b^{(n)}\">\\(b^{(n)}\\)</span> 在下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 是空列。</li>\n<li>签名约化使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_K\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)\\)</span>；符号重命名使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>新常元扩张使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\notin F_L\\cup R_L\">\\(c\\notin F_L\\cup R_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|M|\">\\(a\\in|M|\\)</span>，输出签名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})\">\\(L\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})\\)</span>。子域限制仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)\\)</span> 成立时定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM\\upharpoonright L&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,(f\\mapsto f^M)_{f\\in F_L},(R\\mapsto R^M)_{R\\in R_L})\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_K\\land\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)),\\\\\n\\rho_*M&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,(g\\mapsto(\\rho^{-1}(g))^M)_{g\\in F_K},\n(U\\mapsto(\\rho^{-1}(U))^M)_{U\\in R_K})\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\land\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)),\\\\\nM[c\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,M_1\\cup\\{(c,(\\epsilon\\mapsto a))\\},M_2),\\\\\nb^{(n)}(\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle b(a_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\quad(\\vec a\\in|M|^n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_L(b,M,N)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow b:|M|\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|N|\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\forall\\vec a\\in|M|^{a_L(f)}\\\nb(f^M(\\vec a))=f^N(b^{(a_L(f))}(\\vec a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_L\\forall\\vec a\\in|M|^{a_L(R)}\\\n(\\vec a\\in R^M\\leftrightarrow b^{(a_L(R))}(\\vec a)\\in R^N),\\\\\nM\\cong_LN&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_L(b,M,N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\ne A\\subseteq|M|\n\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\ f^M[A^{a_L(f)}]\\subseteq A,\\\\\nM\\upharpoonright A&amp;\\coloneqq\n(A,(f\\mapsto f^M\\upharpoonright A^{a_L(f)})_{f\\in F_L},\n(R\\mapsto R^M\\cap A^{a_L(R)})_{R\\in R_L})\\quad(\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)),\\\\\nN\\subseteq_LM&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,|N|)\\land N=M\\upharpoonright|N|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM\\upharpoonright L&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,(f\\mapsto f^M)_{f\\in F_L},(R\\mapsto R^M)_{R\\in R_L})\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_K\\land\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)),\\\\\n\\rho_*M&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,(g\\mapsto(\\rho^{-1}(g))^M)_{g\\in F_K},\n(U\\mapsto(\\rho^{-1}(U))^M)_{U\\in R_K})\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_L\\land\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)),\\\\\nM[c\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq(|M|,M_1\\cup\\{(c,(\\epsilon\\mapsto a))\\},M_2),\\\\\nb^{(n)}(\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle b(a_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\quad(\\vec a\\in|M|^n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_L(b,M,N)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow b:|M|\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|N|\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\forall\\vec a\\in|M|^{a_L(f)}\\\nb(f^M(\\vec a))=f^N(b^{(a_L(f))}(\\vec a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_L\\forall\\vec a\\in|M|^{a_L(R)}\\\n(\\vec a\\in R^M\\leftrightarrow b^{(a_L(R))}(\\vec a)\\in R^N),\\\\\nM\\cong_LN&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_L(b,M,N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\ne A\\subseteq|M|\n\\land\\forall f\\in F_L\\ f^M[A^{a_L(f)}]\\subseteq A,\\\\\nM\\upharpoonright A&amp;\\coloneqq\n(A,(f\\mapsto f^M\\upharpoonright A^{a_L(f)})_{f\\in F_L},\n(R\\mapsto R^M\\cap A^{a_L(R)})_{R\\in R_L})\\quad(\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)),\\\\\nN\\subseteq_LM&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,|N|)\\land N=M\\upharpoonright|N|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,K$ 为 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名；结构及其解释族取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]。每个下列构造仅在其列明的输入类型上定义。","embed":fa