\\forall f\\in F_L\\ f^M[A^{a_L(f)}]\\subseteq A,\\\\\nM\\upharpoonright A&\\coloneqq\n(A,(f\\mapsto f^M\\upharpoonright A^{a_L(f)})_{f\\in F_L},\n(R\\mapsto R^M\\cap A^{a_L(R)})_{R\\in R_L})\\quad(\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,A)),\\\\\nN\\subseteq_LM&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Subdom}_L(M,|N|)\\land N=M\\upharpoonright|N|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2753,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 遍历集合大小的一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$、约化、同构与一阶满足关系取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]、[[67-df-isomorphism]]。关于所有签名、结构的量化在元理论中进行。"},{"id":"4c0e8087df7fe695","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是 [[67-df-abstract-logic]] 的候选逻辑；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$。$\\subseteq_\\sigma$ 和新常元扩张取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"1a5df6cf30c97026","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-isomorphism]] — Structure Isomorphisms and Induced Substructures。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-isomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["bc53ba723358facc","3f06c9fe86c236dd"]}